|  | Travel Document / Passport No. | String | Required | Passport number |
|  | Date of Birth | Date | Required | Format: YYYY-MM-DD |
|  | Exemption Type | String | Required | Enter / Exit at non-port of entry |
|  | Location Required | String | Required | Specified border location |
|  | Motivation & Purpose | Long Text | Required | Written justification and reason |
|  | Period Required | Date Range | Required | From Date to To Date |
| DHA-TC-01 (Form 4) | Flight / Ship / Vehicle Reg No. | String | Required | Conveyance identifier |
|  | Reason for Visit | Checkbox/Enum | Required | Resident, Immigrant, Study, Business, Holiday, Transit, Diplomat, Employment, Crew, Other |
|  | Occupation | Checkbox/Enum | Optional | Civil Service, Diplomat, Military/Police, Media, Artist, Charity, Student, Education, Professional, Trade/Business, Other |
|  | Customs Declarations | Boolean (Y/N) | Required | 5 binary check questions (Prohibited goods, Duty Free allowance, Trade goods, Currency limits, Valuable goods) |
|  | Currency Brought | Numeric | Optional | Cash amount in ZAR/USD |
|  | Physical Address in RSA | Object | Required | Unit, Complex, Street No, Street/Farm, Suburb, City/Town, Postal Code |
|  | Contact Person & No. in RSA | String | Optional | Local contact details |
Extracted Form Field Summary
Form 1 (DHA-1756) – Review Request Notification
 * Header: Department of Home Affairs, Republic of South Africa.
 * Part A (Refusal of Admission): Captures To (Name), Passport No., Date of Birth, Nationality, Conveyor/Flight/Vessel Details.
 * Part B (Illegal Foreigner): Captures To (Name), Passport No., Date of Birth, Nationality, Age, Gender.
 * Signatures & Audit: Immigration Officer details (Name, Appointment No., Rank), Recipient Acknowledgement, Interpreter Certification.
Form 2 (DHA-1714A) – Adverse Decision Notice
 * Variants: Part A (Port of Entry), Part B (Permitting), Part C (Inspectorate).
 * Fields: Recipient Name, Location, Reference/Visa/Passport Number, Text of Decision, Reasons for Decision, Review/Representation Timeline Instructions (10 working days).
 * Signatures & Audit: Officer Particulars, Supervisor Particulars (Part C), Acknowledgement of Receipt, Interpreter Certification.
Form 3 (DHA-26) – Non-Port Entry/Exit Exemption
 * Applicant Data: Surname, First Names, Nationality, Passport/Travel Doc No., Date of Birth, Country of Normal Residence, Permanent Residence Permit No., Temporary Sojourn Visa details.
 * Application Data: Action (Enter/Exit), Requested Location, Motivation text, Requested Validity Period (From/To), Purpose.
 * Official Use Block: Approval/Refusal Status, Valid Until date, File No., Section Granted under, Officer Details, Conditions text.
Form 4 (DHA-TC-01) – Traveller Card
 * Travel Details: Flight No./Ship No./Vehicle Reg No., Passport No., Intended Departure Date.
 * Categorization: Reason for Visit (10 options), Occupation (11 options).
 * Customs Questions: 5 Yes/No declaration flags, ZAR/USD Currency Amount.
 * Location & Contacts: Comprehensive RSA Physical Address structure, Local Contact Person, Local Contact Number.
